{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":1,"ref":"micah 7:1","book":"micah","lang":"de","chapter":7,"translation":"Wehe mir! Denn ich bin wie die Nachlesenden des Sommers, wie die Nachlese bei der Weinlese: ⟨Es gibt⟩ keine Traube zu essen, ⟨keine⟩ Frühfeige — ⟨die⟩ meine Nefesch begehrt.","tokens":[{"surface":"אללי","gloss":"Wehe mir"},{"surface":"לי","gloss":"mir"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"denn"},{"surface":"הייתי","gloss":"ich bin wie"},{"surface":"כאספי","gloss":"wie die Nachlesenden"},{"surface":"קיץ","gloss":"des Sommers"},{"surface":"כעללת","gloss":"wie die Nachlese"},{"surface":"בציר","gloss":"bei der Weinlese"},{"surface":"אין","gloss":"⟨es gibt⟩ keine"},{"surface":"אשכול","gloss":"Traube"},{"surface":"לאכול","gloss":"zu essen"},{"surface":"בכורה","gloss":"Frühfeige"},{"surface":"אותה","gloss":"— ⟨die⟩ begehrt"},{"surface":"נפשי","gloss":"meine Nefesch"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T04:03:28.989297823Z","model":"glm-5.2"}